    "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR fixes IDL generation for sign-extended decode variables by emitting the correct `sext(value, first_extended_bit)` call signature, and updates multiple instruction specs so immediates that should be sign-extended are explicitly marked as such (with corresponding golden-doc updates).\n\n**Changes:**\n- Fix `DecodeVariable#extract` to generate `sext(..., size)` rather than a single-argument `sext(...)`.\n- Mark numerous `imm` decode variables as `sign_extend: true` across standard ISA YAML specs so generated decode-variable expressions match intended semantics.\n- Update the generated/golden instruction appendix to reflect `sext(..., N)` in decode-variable tables; ignore `vendor/bundle`.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 36 out of 37 changed files in this pull request and generated no comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/obj/instruction.rb | Generate `sext(value, size)` with the required second argument (bit-width / first-extended-bit). |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/Zfh/fsh.yaml | Mark `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/Zfh/flh.yaml | Mark `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/Q/fsq.yaml | Mark `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/Q/flq.yaml | Mark `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/xori.yaml | Mark `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/sw.yaml | Mark store offset `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/sltiu.yaml | Mark `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/slti.yaml | Mark `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/sh.yaml | Mark store offset `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/sd.yaml | Mark store offset `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/sb.yaml | Mark store offset `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/ori.yaml | Mark `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/lwu.yaml | Mark load offset `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/lw.yaml | Mark load offset `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/lui.yaml | Mark `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation (U-type). |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/lhu.yaml | Mark load offset `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/lh.yaml | Mark load offset `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/ld.yaml | Mark load offset `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation (both encodings). |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/lbu.yaml | Mark load offset `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/lb.yaml | Mark load offset `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/auipc.yaml | Mark `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation (U-type). |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/andi.yaml | Mark `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/addiw.yaml | Mark `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/addi.yaml | Mark `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/F/fsw.yaml | Mark store offset `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/F/flw.yaml | Mark load offset `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/D/fsd.yaml | Mark store offset `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/D/fld.yaml | Mark load offset `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/C/c.lui.yaml | Mark compressed `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/C/c.li.yaml | Mark compressed `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/C/c.andi.yaml | Mark compressed `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/C/c.addiw.yaml | Mark compressed `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/C/c.addi16sp.yaml | Mark compressed `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/C/c.addi.yaml | Mark compressed `imm` as sign-extended for correct decode expression generation. |\r\n| backends/instructions_appendix/all_instructions.golden.adoc | Update decode-variable tables to show `sext(..., N)` with explicit width/first-extended-bit. |\r\n| .gitignore | Ignore Bundler install directory `vendor/bundle`. |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/riscv/riscv-unified-db/new/main/.github/instructions?filename=*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.",
